  "notable_quotes": [
    "Three new Zn-triazolate-dicarboxylate frameworks, [Zn2(atz)2(ipa)] (1), [Zn2(datz)2(ipa)] (2), and [Zn2(atz)2(oba)] (3), were synthesized solvothermally.",
    "Thermal stability is uneven after desolvation: 1 is stable to 420 °C, but 2 and 3 are only stable to about 120 and 150 °C, respectively.",
    "Compound 2 is thermally less robust: at 120 °C, 2·MeOH transforms to another crystalline phase before collapsing at 440 °C."
